Description: Aurora desktop icons and Plasma distribution artwork
 The Aurora logo as the aurora-logo-icon and start-here icons of the hicolor
 theme and as /usr/share/pixmaps/system-logo-white.png, and the Plasma
 About this System branding (/etc/xdg/kcm-about-distrorc).
 .
 Debian's desktop-base ships its own kcm-about-distrorc; this package takes
 that file over.
